    535  f258							; walking the whole swept path. The sweep/phase machine is gone: bank0
    536  f258							; LaserInput now travels LaserX +/-4px/frame from the eye, capped at the
    537  f258							; old sweep extent (RoomX+20 / max(RoomX-20,0)) and resets on contact, so
