    810  f3c4							; PickPlayerFrame body — entered from bank0's VBL via the $FDE1 tramp (the
    811  f3c4							; jmp operand is fetched from THIS bank). GRP0 frame pick: jet flutter
    812  f3c4							; (PlayerSpriteA/B) > ground walk (PlayerWalkA/B, phase EnemyRamP&$08) >
    813  f3c4							; static A. Clobbers A/Y; sets Grp0Ptr/Grp0PtrHi; tail-jmps ReturnPad so the
    814  f3c4							; VBL jsr returns in bank0 (pads must not nest — no rts here).
    815  f3c4							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
