   1922  fcf0							; $FE80 tramp -> `jmp $FCF0` here). Fold-free: the hot-rect stream (RoomRects)
   1923  fcf0							; is level data in THIS bank, so the 7 `jsr FoldIndirect` become direct
   1924  fcf0							; `lda (FetchPtr),Y` (one less push level on the hot path too).
