   1928  fcf0							; rejected position. Hot record = parent mask, x, y, w, h (5 B); parent mask
   1929  fcf0							; & BombPacked != 0 = that wall was blasted -> hot piece dead.
   1930  fcf0							; Contract: TAIL-CALLED from bank0 (`jmp`, 0 push) — every exit must return
   1931  fcf0							; C=1 to the ORIGINAL PlayerHitsMap caller. Exits therefore end
   1932  fcf0							; `sec / jmp $FBF8` (ReturnPad: sta $1FF6 switches to bank0, rts pops the
   1933  fcf0							; pre-tramp return address; sta touches neither A nor flags -> C survives).
