   2035  fd78							; Feature-record dispatch ($80 phase / $81 vcrunch / $82 hcrunch — Phase 4):
   2036  fd78							; armed/overlap/kill tests live in bank3 (HOVFeatEntry). $80 phase: b5 armed
   2037  fd78							; (staged by PhaseBlink each VBL) + candidate-box overlap → shared Hot hit
