   2059  fd87							; Entered from bank0 stub (sta $1FF8 / jmp <here> — operand in kernel.asm,
   2060  fd87							; twin at $FDD8 below), 0 pushes; every exit `jmp $FBF8` ReturnPad.
   2061  fd87							; Out: A = 1 kill (caller awards +50 — pads cannot nest), 0 none (Z set).
   2062  fd87							; Clobbers A/X/Y. Level enemy records live in THIS bank, so the type read
