   2149  fe00							; body only ever runs bank2-side)
   2150  fe00				   PHMOverlay
   2151  fe00							; Phase 4 asym-patch collision (entered via OverlayTramp, 0 pushes).
   2152  fe00							; LineCount packed: b4-b7 = right_col+1, b0-2 = bands with the painted
   2153  fe00							; ball-strip ($ff BandTab entries). D6 envelope: ONE right column
   2154  fe00							; [BallX-7, BallX] px, BallX = 87+8*rc — overlay is additive (cells
   2155  fe00							; painted only where the mirrored cell is open, never hot).
   2156  fe00							; Exact visible_left (same math as PHM's prologue), then px overlap of
   2157  fe00							; [vl, vl+6] (PLAYER_WIDTH=7 lit) with the patch column, then band x rows.
