   2466  ff59							; VcrShutter — sprite-shutter staging (vcrunch_shutter_plan Phase B).
   2467  ff59							; Tail-entered from PhVcrPre (PhaseBlink walk, 0 pushes — the VBL chain sits
   2468  ff59							; on the measured SP floor) and tail-exits at .PhRec.
   2469  ff59							;   IN:  FetchPtr = hot record stream, Y = record base (class byte)
   2470  ff59							;   OUT: Y = base+4 (.PhRec contract: its iny -> base+5 = next class)
   2471  ff59							;   Clobbers A/X/Y + LineCount/CollisionCellX/CollisionEndY/Temp (all
